{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UoLD2Bte71DefpqXcnybKB","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Claim 1（bias identity）完全确认，升级为 primary contribution——R² 接近 1.0，debiasing-hurts\n2\t  在 ~50% 参数空间成立， 独立于 EC-HTE 是否被采用均具价值。Claim 2（EC-HTE）成立但 boundary conditions 显著：RMSE\n3\t  优势仅限 extreme  heterogeneity + n_expert/K ≥ 25-50；moderate regime 下 global 常优于 EC-HTE\n4\t  on RMSE。Claim 3 从 diagnostic  criterion 降级为 diagnostic heuristic——setting-level\n5\t  CV AUC 停留在 0.45-0.65，仅 subgroup-level 有预测力。 Real data illustrative 而非 conclusive：Δπ\n6\t  存在但 EC-HTE 未胜出（高 FNR + 小 n_expert/subgroup）。 PPCI 互补性成为关键卖点弥补 EC-HTE 单独使用的局限。论文需调整\n7\t  claims 强度但仍 EMNLP-competitive， 预期 1-2R 后 accept。\n8\t\n9\t  '\n10\timagined_experiments:\n11\t- name: HB EC-HTE Synthetic Validation\n12\t  plan_id: exp-001\n13\t  description: 'HB Dirichlet-prior confusion matrix estimator + partial pooling，3600\n14\t    MC runs across  extreme/moderate/homogeneous × n_expert {50,100,250,500,1000,2000}\n15\t    × K={2,4}。 与 MLE/Laplace 对比。全 MCMC 诊断 + hyperprior sensitivity。\n16\t\n17\t    '\n18\t  expected_results:\n19\t    mcmc_rhat_max: 1.02\n20\t    mcmc_ess_min: 150\n21\t    mcmc_divergent: 0\n22\t    runtime_min: 70\n23\t    total_mc_runs: 3600\n24\t    hb_vs_mle_rmse_improvement_k2_n50: 4-9%\n25\t    hb_vs_mle_rmse_improvement_k2_n100: 1-2%\n26\t    hb_vs_mle_rmse_improvement_k4_n50_moderate: 6-9%\n27\t    hb_coverage_min: 0.87\n28\t    hb_coverage_median: 0.93\n29\t    k4_extreme_n50_blowup: false\n30\t    k4_extreme_n50_note: singularity guard + 4-chain MCMC 后修复，但该配置仍不推荐\n31\t    hyperprior_sensitivity_k2: <1%\n32\t    hyperprior_sensitivity_k4: ~4-5%\n33\t    rmse_penalty_k4_extreme_n50: 1.4-2.8x vs global (MLE blowup, HB 部分缓解)\n34\t    rmse_penalty_k4_extreme_n100: ~1.2x vs global\n35\t    hb_converges_to_mle_at: n≥1000 (<0.5% difference)\n36\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 HB partial pooling 提供实质性但有条件的改进。K=2 场景下 HB 与 MLE 差异较小（1-9%），\n37\t    因为只有 2 个 subgroup 可借鉴信息有限。K=4 场景下 HB 的 shrinkage 优势更明显（尤其 n=50 的  minority subgroup），因为有\n38\t    4 个 subgroup 提供 cross-group 信息。但 K=4/extreme/n=50 配置中  n_expert/K=12.5 < 25 的\n39\t    boundary condition 是真实的——per-subgroup CM 估计噪声过大，矩阵求逆  放大误差，导致 RMSE 恶化。4-chain\n40\t    MCMC + singularity guard 消除数值灾难但不改变根本的统计限制。 Hyperprior 对 K=2 几乎无影响（只有 2 组，shrinkage\n41\t    target 稳定），K=4 有 ~4-5% 变化但 coverage  不变，说明 HB 对先验规格稳健。整体结论：HB 在 n_expert/K ≥ 25\n42\t    时安全推荐，低于此阈值需回退至  stratified MLE 或 global。\n43\t\n44\t    '\n45\t  tables:\n46\t  - name: 'Table 1: HB vs MLE RMSE Comparison'\n47\t    columns:\n48\t    - K\n49\t    - regime\n50\t    - n_expert\n51\t    - rmse_mle\n52\t    - rmse_hb\n53\t    - hb_improvement_pct\n54\t    - coverage_hb\n55\t    key_rows:\n56\t    - - 2\n57\t      - extreme\n58\t      - 50\n59\t      - 0.375\n60\t      - 0.395\n61\t      - -5.3%\n62\t      - 0.87\n63\t    - - 2\n64\t      - extreme\n65\t      - 250\n66\t      - 0.126\n67\t      - 0.125\n68\t      - +0.8%\n69\t      - 0.94\n70\t    - - 4\n71\t      - extreme\n72\t      - 50\n73\t      - 1.73\n74\t      - 1.42\n75\t      - +17.9%\n76\t      - 0.88\n77\t    - - 4\n78\t      - extreme\n79\t      - 250\n80\t      - 0.88\n81\t      - 0.89\n82\t      - -1.1%\n83\t      - 0.92\n84\t    - - 4\n85\t      - moderate\n86\t      - 50\n87\t      - 1.31\n88\t      - 0.87\n89\t      - +33.6%\n90\t      - 0.9\n91\t  - name: 'Table 2: Hyperprior Sensitivity (Gamma scale ×0.5 to ×2.0)'\n92\t    columns:\n93\t    - K\n94\t    - scale_factor\n95\t    - rmse_change\n96\t    - coverage_change\n97\t    key_rows:\n98\t    - - 2\n99\t      - 0.5-2.0\n100\t      - <1%\n101\t      - invariant\n102\t    - - 4\n103\t      - 0.5-2.0\n104\t      - ~4-5%\n105\t      - invariant\n106\t  figures_description:\n107\t  - HB vs MLE RMSE ratio heatmap across (K, n_expert, regime) grid\n108\t  - 'Convergence plot: HB-MLE RMSE gap vs n_expert，showing approach to 0 at n≥1000'\n109\t  analysis: 'HB 的核心价值在 median 档下被精确定位：它是 James-Stein shrinkage estimator，在 moderate\n110\t    subgroup  count (K=4) 且 n_expert 中等 (100-500) 时提供最大边际收益。但它不是 \"never worse than\n111\t    global\"—— 在 K=4/n≤100 时 RMSE 可比 global 差 1.2-3.5x。Paper 必须诚实报告此 tradeoff 并给出 per-subgroup  threshold\n112\t    (n_expert/K ≥ 25)。\n113\t\n114\t    '\n115\t- name: Bias Identity Verification\n116\t  plan_id: exp-002\n117\t  description: '解析推导 bias = f(Δπ, Δτ) product form，通过 systematic parameter grid MC\n118\t    验证。 K=2 和 K=4 extension。Debiasing-hurts proposition 构造性证明。\n119\t\n120\t    '\n121\t  expected_results:\n122\t    r2_k2: 0.993\n123\t    r2_k4: 0.974\n124\t    tightness_ratio_k2_median: 1.003\n125\t    tightness_ratio_k4_median: 1.023\n126\t    debiasing_hurts_pct: 50\n127\t    debiasing_hurts_pct_detail: ~260/520 (排除 dc=0 rows)\n128\t    max_bias_ratio_k2_dim: 2.8\n129\t    max_bias_ratio_k4_dim: 2.4\n130\t    debiasing_hurts_threshold_delta_misclass: 0.12\n131\t    coverage_2se_k2: 0.95\n132\t    coverage_2se_k4: 0.94\n133\t    product_form_exact: true\n134\t    a2_symmetric_required: false\n135\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 bias identity 完全成立（这是 exact identity at population\n136\t    level，不是 bound）。 K=2 的 R²=0.993 接近 1.0，剩余 ~0.7% 是 MC 有限样本噪声而非理论松弛。K=4 的 R²=0.974  略低，因为\n137\t    4-subgroup 配置下 sum-of-products form 有更多交叉项，MC 估计方差更大，但仍确认  product structure。Debiasing-hurts\n138\t    在 ~50% parameter space 成立是因为当 naive bias 本身很小 （Δτ≈0 或 misclassification 恰好 symmetric）时，global\n139\t    correction 引入的 systematic shift  反而超过原始 bias。Max amplification K=2=2.8x > K=4=2.4x\n140\t    对 DIM estimator 看似反直觉，但因为  K=2 extreme 配置中两个 subgroup 的 π 差距更大（如 0.25 vs 0.05），correction\n141\t    的 over/under-shoot  更集中；K=4 时 π 值更分散，极端 mismatch 被平均化。这个 K-dependence 非单调模式是 DIM-specific  的——CausalForest\n142\t    中 K=4 amplification 更高（exp-011）。Product form 在 asymmetric misclassification  下仍然精确成立（A2\n143\t    not required），由 exp-014 补充验证。\n144\t\n145\t    '\n146\t  tables:\n147\t  - name: 'Table 3: Bias Identity R² Verification'\n148\t    columns:\n149\t    - K\n150\t    - R2\n151\t    - tightness_ratio_median\n152\t    - tightness_ratio_95th\n153\t    - coverage_2SE\n154\t    key_rows:\n155\t    - - 2\n156\t      - 0.993\n157\t      - 1.003\n158\t      - 1.015\n159\t      - 0.95\n160\t    - - 4\n161\t      - 0.974\n162\t      - 1.023\n163\t      - 1.065\n164\t      - 0.94\n165\t  - name: 'Table 4: Debiasing-Hurts Summary'\n166\t    columns:\n167\t    - K\n168\t    - total_configs\n169\t    - debiasing_hurts_count\n170\t    - pct\n171\t    - max_amplification\n172\t    - threshold_Δπ\n173\t    key_rows:\n174\t    - - 2\n175\t      - 260\n176\t      - ~130\n177\t      - ~50%\n178\t      - 2.8\n179\t      - 0.12\n180\t    - - 4\n181\t      - 260\n182\t      - ~130\n183\t      - ~50%\n184\t      - 2.4\n185\t      - 0.12\n186\t  figures_description:\n187\t  - 'Bias amplification heatmap: Δπ (x-axis) vs Δτ (y-axis), color = bias ratio (global/naive).\n188\t    Paper Figure 2.'\n189\t  - 'Scatter: analytic prediction vs MC bias, K=2 and K=4 panels, with R² annotation'\n190\t  analysis: 'Bias identity 是本文 primary contribution。Median 档下完全确认：population-level\n191\t    exact identity  在有限样本中 R²>0.97。Debiasing-hurts 50% 的比例足够 dramatic 支撑 Claim 1 的\n192\t    practical relevance。 max amplification 2.4-2.8x (DIM) 在 median 范围内，足以引起审稿人注意但不会被质疑为\n193\t    cherry-picked  extreme case。此 claim 独立于 EC-HTE 是否被采用——即使读者不使用 EC-HTE，knowing when\n194\t    global  correction backfires 本身就是 actionable 的。\n195\t\n196\t    '\n197\t- name: Semi-Synthetic CSS Benchmark\n198\t  plan_id: exp-003\n199\t  description: 'TweetEval sentiment (N=45K) 上注入 CATE heterogeneity，GPT-4.1 annotation，\n200\t    K=4 subgroups (text features)，100 MC runs，全方法对比。\n201\t\n202\t    '\n203\t  expected_results:\n204\t    n_subgroups: 4\n205\t    misclass_rates: S0=0.05, S1=0.10, S2=0.15, S3=0.25\n206\t    p_z1_actual: 0.39\n207\t    delta_pi: 0.2\n208\t    debiasing_hurts_confirmed: true\n209\t    mc_runs: 100\n210\t    hb_vs_mle_n100_S3_extreme: +50-60% RMSE (HB dramatically better)\n211\t    hb_vs_mle_n50_S3_extreme: -50-60% RMSE (HB worse, boundary condition)\n212\t    hb_vs_mle_n250_all: +5-17% RMSE (HB modestly better)\n213\t    hb_boundary_condition: n_expert≥100 recommended; n=50 with extreme heterogeneity\n214\t      in minority subgroups degrades\n215\t    coverage_hb_median: 0.93\n216\t    coverage_naive_median: 0.87\n217\t  result_rationale: 'Semi-synthetic DGP 用真实 text features 构造 4 subgroups，misclassification\n218\t    rates 从 5% 到 25%  跨越 5 倍差距（Δπ=0.20），这足以触发 debiasing-hurts。S3 是 minority subgroup\n219\t    (~12% 样本) 且  misclass rate 最高 (25%)，是 correction 最需要但也最困难的对象。n=50 时 S3 只有 ~6 个\n220\t    expert  labels（50×12%），HB posterior 被先验主导，correction 噪声大于信号——这是 median 档的核心 boundary  condition。n=100\n221\t    时 S3 有 ~12 个 expert labels，刚过 HB crossover 阈值，partial pooling 开始  生效，HB 显著优于 MLE（+50-60%）因为\n222\t    MLE 在这么少样本上完全不稳定。n≥250 时两者收敛。 Coverage 是关键区分指标：naive ~87% 系统性低于 nominal 95%（因\n223\t    misclassification bias 未被 CI 覆盖）， HB ~93% 接近但未完全达到 nominal（因 finite-sample CM\n224\t    估计不确定性）。\n225\t\n226\t    '\n227\t  tables:\n228\t  - name: 'Table 5: Semi-Synthetic Results by Method and n_expert'\n229\t    columns:\n230\t    - n_expert\n231\t    - method\n232\t    - mean_abs_bias\n233\t    - rmse\n234\t    - coverage\n235\t    key_rows:\n236\t    - - 100\n237\t      - oracle\n238\t      - 0.01\n239\t      - 0.05\n240\t      - 0.96\n241\t    - - 100\n242\t      - naive\n243\t      - 0.06\n244\t      - 0.08\n245\t      - 0.87\n246\t    - - 100\n247\t      - global_corrected\n248\t      - 0.04\n249\t      - 0.09\n250\t      - 0.92\n251\t    - - 100\n252\t      - mle_stratified\n253\t      - 0.03\n254\t      - 0.1\n255\t      - 0.94\n256\t    - - 100\n257\t      - hb_ec_hte\n258\t      - 0.02\n259\t      - 0.09\n260\t      - 0.93\n261\t    - - 50\n262\t      - hb_ec_hte\n263\t      - 0.04\n264\t      - 0.14\n265\t      - 0.9\n266\t    - - 250\n267\t      - hb_ec_hte\n268\t      - 0.01\n269\t      - 0.07\n270\t      - 0.95\n271\t  - name: 'Table 6: S3 (Minority Subgroup) Detail'\n272\t    columns:\n273\t    - n_expert\n274\t    - method\n275\t    - S3_rmse\n276\t    - S3_coverage\n277\t    key_rows:\n278\t    - - 50\n279\t      - mle_stratified\n280\t      - 0.35\n281\t      - 0.88\n282\t    - - 50\n283\t      - hb_ec_hte\n284\t      - 0.55\n285\t      - 0.87\n286\t    - - 100\n287\t      - mle_stratified\n288\t      - 0.18\n289\t      - 0.91\n290\t    - - 100\n291\t      - hb_ec_hte\n292\t      - 0.07\n293\t      - 0.94\n294\t  figures_description:\n295\t  - Per-subgroup RMSE curves vs n_expert for HB vs MLE vs Global, highlighting S3\n296\t    crossover\n297\t  - 'Coverage calibration plot: nominal vs empirical coverage across methods'\n298\t  analysis: 'Semi-synthetic 验证了 median 档的核心叙事：EC-HTE 在 extreme heterogeneity 下有效，但受\n299\t    n_expert/K  约束显著。S3 的 dramatic crossover（n=50 HB 差，n=100 HB 好）是论文中 \"When NOT to\n300\t    use EC-HTE\"  小节的 empirical basis。Coverage 优势比 RMSE 优势更稳健——即使在 RMSE 略差的配置下，HB 的\n301\t    coverage  仍接近 nominal。\n302\t\n303\t    '\n304\t- name: Real-Data Case Study (Pattern Consistency)\n305\t  plan_id: exp-004\n306\t  description: 'UC Berkeley Measuring Hate Speech corpus，GPT-4.1 annotation， text-feature\n307\t    subgroups (platform × text_length)，bootstrap CIs。 Illustrative application, NOT\n308\t    ground-truth benchmark。\n309\t\n310\t    '\n311\t  expected_results:\n312\t    dataset: UC Berkeley Measuring Hate Speech\n313\t    n_comments: 2496\n314\t    subgroup_type: platform_group × text_length\n315\t    delta_pi: 0.117\n316\t    global_FPR: 0.14\n317\t    global_FNR: 0.53\n318\t    avg_abs_bias_naive: 0.21\n319\t    avg_abs_bias_global: 0.273\n320\t    avg_abs_bias_ec_hte: 0.313\n321\t    ec_hte_vs_global_bias_diff: 0.04\n322\t    cate_comparison: inconclusive — EC-HTE does not outperform global\n323\t    bootstrap_ci_width: wide, overlapping\n324\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 real data 是 illustrative 而非 conclusive。ec_hte_vs_global\n325\t    bias diff = +0.04  落在 median 范围 [-0.05, 0.05] 内，意味着统计上无法区分。根本原因有三：(1) Global FNR=53%  说明\n326\t    GPT-4.1 严重低估 dehumanization（超过一半的正例被漏掉），导致 confusion matrix 高度不对称， correction\n327\t    的 signal-to-noise ratio 低；(2) Δπ=0.117 虽然统计显著但绝对值不大——4 个 subgroup  的 misclass\n328\t    rate 从 0.266 到 0.383，跨度有限，EC-HTE 相对于 global 的边际收益小；(3) 2496  comments / 4 subgroups\n329\t    / bootstrap splitting 后 per-subgroup n_expert 不足，CM 估计噪声大。 这恰好印证了 Claim 2 的 boundary\n330\t    condition 和 Claim 3 的降级——在 moderate heterogeneity +  limited expert labels 的真实条件下，EC-HTE\n331\t    的优势不 manifest。论文中将此 framing 为  \"heterogeneity 存在且结构性（支持 Claim 1），但 EC-HTE 需要更强的条件才能\n332\t    outperform（支持  Claim 2 的 boundary 叙事）\"。\n333\t\n334\t    '\n335\t  tables:\n336\t  - name: 'Table 7: Real-Data CATE Comparison'\n337\t    columns:\n338\t    - method\n339\t    - avg_abs_bias\n340\t    - bootstrap_95CI\n341\t    - interpretation\n342\t    key_rows:\n343\t    - - naive\n344\t      - 0.21\n345\t      - '[0.15, 0.27]'\n346\t      - baseline\n347\t    - - global_corrected\n348\t      - 0.273\n349\t      - '[0.20, 0.35]'\n350\t      - over-correction due to high FNR\n351\t    - - ec_hte\n352\t      - 0.313\n353\t      - '[0.22, 0.40]'\n354\t      - additional noise from subgroup CM estimation\n355\t  - name: 'Table 8: Subgroup Misclassification Rates'\n356\t    columns:\n357\t    - subgroup\n358\t    - n\n359\t    - misclass_rate\n360\t    - FPR\n361\t    - FNR\n362\t    key_rows:\n363\t    - - plat0_long\n364\t      - 624\n365\t      - 0.266\n366\t      - 0.1\n367\t      - 0.55\n368\t    - - plat0_short\n369\t      - 624\n370\t      - 0.337\n371\t      - 0.15\n372\t      - 0.58\n373\t    - - plat23_long\n374\t      - 624\n375\t      - 0.303\n376\t      - 0.12\n377\t      - 0.52\n378\t    - - plat23_short\n379\t      - 624\n380\t      - 0.383\n381\t      - 0.18\n382\t      - 0.5\n383\t  figures_description:\n384\t  - Subgroup-level CATE point estimates with bootstrap CIs, three methods side by\n385\t    side\n386\t  - Misclassification rate bar chart across subgroups with error bars\n387\t  analysis: 'Real data 结果精确匹配 median 档预期：heterogeneity 存在但 EC-HTE 无法 outperform。这不是  method\n388\t    failure 而是 operating condition mismatch——FNR=53% 是极端不对称，Δπ=0.117 是 moderate  heterogeneity，per-subgroup\n389\t    expert labels 不足。论文将此缩短为 illustrative application， 着重展示 (a) heterogeneity 是结构性的（支持\n390\t    Claim 1 的 real-world relevance），(b) EC-HTE  需要更好的条件才能发挥优势（honest disclosure strengthens\n391\t    credibility）。\n392\t\n393\t    '\n394\t- name: Diagnostic Criterion Validation\n395\t  plan_id: exp-005\n396\t  description: 'Δπ × Δτ product 从 pilot data 计算，across 全部实验 settings， leave-one-setting-out\n397\t    CV evaluation，ROC analysis。\n398\t\n399\t    '\n400\t  expected_results:\n401\t    diagnostic_auc_cv_setting_level: 0.49\n402\t    diagnostic_auc_subgroup_level: 0.833\n403\t    subgroup_correlation_pi_vs_bias_direction: 0.86\n404\t    low_pi_hurt_pct: 84.6\n405\t    high_pi_hurt_pct: 15.4\n406\t    theory_alignment: consistent with exp-002 formula\n407\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档的 defining feature 是 Claim 3 降级为 heuristic。Setting-level\n408\t    CV AUC=0.49  实质等于随机猜测——这是因为 setting-level 的 \"debiasing hurts\" 判定取决于所有 subgroup\n409\t    的  aggregate，而 aggregate 受 subgroup 权重、CATE 方向、和 misclass 分布的复杂交互影响， 单一 Δπ×Δτ\n410\t    product 无法 capture 这些 higher-order effects。具体来说，setting A 中  debiasing 可能 hurt\n411\t    subgroup 0 但 help subgroup 1，net effect 取决于 subgroup size ratio  ——这是 product\n412\t    form 理论上 exact 但 empirically 在 setting level 预测力弱的原因。 Subgroup-level AUC=0.833\n413\t    仍有价值：在 subgroup 粒度上，Δπ 大的 subgroup 有 84.6% 概率  被 debiasing 伤害（vs 15.4% for low\n414\t    Δπ），这与 bias identity 完全一致。但 0.833 不够  支撑独立 claim——false positive rate ~15% 意味着每\n415\t    ~7 个标记中有 1 个误报。 降级路径：Claim 3 从 \"diagnostic criterion (决策工具)\" 重写为 \"diagnostic heuristic  (标记\n416\t    subgroup-level risk 的工具)\"，用于与 budget analysis (exp-006) 联合决策。\n417\t\n418\t    '\n419\t  tables:\n420\t  - name: 'Table 9: Diagnostic Performance Summary'\n421\t    columns:\n422\t    - level\n423\t    - AUC\n424\t    - sensitivity\n425\t    - specificity\n426\t    - interpretation\n427\t    key_rows:\n428\t    - - setting_level_cv\n429\t      - 0.49\n430\t      - 0.52\n431\t      - 0.48\n432\t      - no better than chance\n433\t    - - subgroup_level\n434\t      - 0.833\n435\t      - 0.85\n436\t      - 0.75\n437\t      - useful heuristic, not reliable criterion\n438\t  - name: 'Table 10: Subgroup-Level Diagnostic Breakdown'\n439\t    columns:\n440\t    - pi_category\n441\t    - n_subgroups\n442\t    - hurt_pct\n443\t    - not_hurt_pct\n444\t    key_rows:\n445\t    - - high_pi\n446\t      - 26\n447\t      - 84.6%\n448\t      - 15.4%\n449\t    - - low_pi\n450\t      - 26\n451\t      - 15.4%\n452\t      - 84.6%\n453\t  figures_description:\n454\t  - 'ROC curve: subgroup-level prediction, with AUC annotation and diagonal reference.\n455\t    Paper Figure 3.'\n456\t  - 'Calibration plot: predicted probability of debiasing-hurts vs observed frequency'\n457\t  analysis: 'Setting-level AUC=0.49 是 median 档最大的单点弱化。审稿人会质疑 \"why call it a diagnostic  if\n458\t    it can''t predict at the analysis level?\" Rebuttal strategy: (1) reframe as subgroup-level  heuristic\n459\t    (AUC=0.83)，(2) argue subgroup-level is the actionable granularity for EC-HTE  决策，(3)\n460\t    connect to budget recommendation——diagnostic flags which subgroups need stratified  correction,\n461\t    budget analysis determines whether you can afford it. 这个 three-legged stool  (Claim\n462\t    1 identifies problem, Claim 3 flags risk subgroups, exp-006 determines budget)  是\n463\t    median 档的核心 defense strategy。\n464\t\n465\t    '\n466\t- name: Expert Label Budget Sensitivity\n467\t  plan_id: exp-006\n468\t  description: 'Systematic sweep n_expert ∈ {50,100,250,500,1000,2000} × K ∈ {2,4}\n469\t    × regime ∈ {extreme,moderate}。 Find RMSE crossover points where HB > Global。\n470\t\n471\t    '\n472\t  expected_results:\n473\t    n_mc: 100\n474\t    total_rows: 288\n475\t    crossover_hb_beats_global:\n476\t      K2_extreme: 250\n477\t      K2_moderate: never (global always better on RMSE)\n478\t      K4_extreme: 1000\n479\t      K4_moderate: 2000\n480\t    hb_vs_mle_pct_better: 87.5% (21/24 configs)\n481\t    hb_best_improvement_over_mle_k4_moderate_n50: +42%\n482\t    hb_convergence_to_mle: n≥1000 (<0.5%)\n483\t    rmse_penalty_k4_extreme_n50: 4.8x vs global\n484\t    rmse_penalty_k4_extreme_n100: 4.0x vs global\n485\t    rmse_penalty_k4_extreme_n250: 3.1x vs global\n486\t    rmse_penalty_k4_moderate_n50: 5.0x vs global\n487\t  result_rationale: 'Crossover thresholds 是 Claim 2 boundary conditions 的量化核心。K=2/extreme\n488\t    在 n=250 crossover  是因为只需要估计 2 个 2×2 confusion matrices (8 参数)，n=250 提供 ~125 labels/subgroup，足以  精确估计。K=4/extreme\n489\t    需要估计 4 个 2×2 CM (16 参数) 且 minority subgroups 只占 ~12%， n=1000 时 minority 有 ~120\n490\t    labels 才够。K=4/moderate 在 n=2000 crossover 因为 moderate  heterogeneity 下 EC-HTE\n491\t    的 bias reduction 边际收益小（Δπ 只有 ~0.10），需要极其精确的 CM  估计才能在 RMSE 上胜过 global 的低方差。K=2/moderate\n492\t    never crosses 因为 Δπ 太小， stratified correction 永远无法在 bias reduction 上弥补增加的方差。\n493\t\n494\t    RMSE penalty 在小 n 时达到 1.2-3.5x (median 范围)，最极端可达 ~5x。这是因为 K=4/n=50 时  minority\n495\t    subgroup 仅 ~6 labels，CM 行之和约束下有效自由度极低，矩阵求逆放大估计噪声。 HB 相比 MLE 在 87.5% 配置中更好，主要贡献在\n496\t    small-n minority subgroups (partial pooling  borrowing from majority subgroups)。\n497\t\n498\t    '\n499\t  tables:\n500\t  - name: 'Table 11: RMSE Crossover Summary'\n501\t    columns:\n502\t    - K\n503\t    - regime\n504\t    - crossover_n_expert\n505\t    - interpretation\n506\t    key_rows:\n507\t    - - 2\n508\t      - extreme\n509\t      - 250\n510\t      - practical — 250 expert labels feasible\n511\t    - - 2\n512\t      - moderate\n513\t      - never\n514\t      - global correction sufficient\n515\t    - - 4\n516\t      - extreme\n517\t      - 1000\n518\t      - higher bar — 1000 labels needed\n519\t    - - 4\n520\t      - moderate\n521\t      - 2000\n522\t      - marginal case — cost-benefit questionable\n523\t  - name: 'Table 12: RMSE Penalty at Small n'\n524\t    columns:\n525\t    - K\n526\t    - regime\n527\t    - n_expert\n528\t    - rmse_hb\n529\t    - rmse_global\n530\t    - penalty_ratio\n531\t    key_rows:\n532\t    - - 4\n533\t      - extreme\n534\t      - 50\n535\t      - 1.42\n536\t      - 0.29\n537\t      - 4.9x\n538\t    - - 4\n539\t      - extreme\n540\t      - 100\n541\t      - 1.15\n542\t      - 0.29\n543\t      - 4.0x\n544\t    - - 4\n545\t      - extreme\n546\t      - 250\n547\t      - 0.89\n548\t      - 0.29\n549\t      - 3.1x\n550\t    - - 4\n551\t      - moderate\n552\t      - 50\n553\t      - 0.87\n554\t      - 0.18\n555\t      - 4.9x\n556\t    - - 2\n557\t      - extreme\n558\t      - 50\n559\t      - 0.4\n560\t      - 0.14\n561\t      - 2.8x\n562\t  figures_description:\n563\t  - 'Budget crossover curves: RMSE vs n_expert for HB vs Global, 4 panels (K×regime).\n564\t    Paper Figure 4.'\n565\t  - 'Heatmap: HB-Global RMSE ratio across (K, n_expert, regime) grid, red=HB worse,\n566\t    blue=HB better'\n567\t  analysis: 'Budget sensitivity 是 median 档论文的 \"Expert Budget Recommendation\" 小节的 empirical\n568\t    basis。 Key message: K=2/extreme 在 n=250 crossover（实际可行），K=4/extreme 需 n=1000（较高但  可行），K=2/moderate\n569\t    和 K=4/moderate 的 crossover 很晚或不存在（global is fine）。 这直接连接到 Claim 3：diagnostic heuristic\n570\t    标记 extreme heterogeneity 的 subgroups， budget analysis 确定是否值得投资 stratified correction。Honest\n571\t    framing: \"when the diagnostic  flags high heterogeneity, EC-HTE is worth the investment;\n572\t    when heterogeneity is low, global  correction is the safer and cheaper choice.\"\n573\t\n574\t    '\n575\t- name: PPCI + DSL Baseline Comparison\n576\t  plan_id: exp-007\n577\t  description: '4 DGPs (covariate-only / outcome-only / both / no-error) × 8 methods\n578\t    × 100 MC。 EC-HTE+PPCI composition for dual error。Pure covariate-error control\n579\t    condition。\n580\t\n581\t    '\n582\t  expected_results:\n583\t    total_rows: 6912\n584\t    dgps:\n585\t    - A_covariate_only\n586\t    - B_outcome_only\n587\t    - C_both_errors\n588\t    - D_no_error\n589\t    methods: 8\n590\t    dgp_c_extreme_n250_k2:\n591\t      ec_hte_ppci_bias_z0: 0.005\n592\t      ec_hte_ppci_rmse_z0: 0.225\n593\t      ec_hte_bias_z0: 0.178\n594\t      ppci_bias_z0: 0.004\n595\t      ppci_rmse_z0: 0.261\n596\t      naive_bias_z0: 0.251\n597\t    dgp_a_ec_hte_ppci_equals_ec_hte: true\n598\t    ec_hte_ppci_bias_reduction_vs_ec_hte_alone: 35x in DGP C\n599\t    ppci_higher_variance: true\n600\t    dsl_per_subgroup_valid_but_higher_variance: true\n601\t  result_rationale: 'DGP C (both errors) 是 PPCI 互补性的关键测试场。ec_hte_ppci bias=0.005 落在\n602\t    median 范围  [0.003, 0.015] 内——near-zero 但非 exact zero，因为 PPCI rectifier 在有限样本上有残余误差。\n603\t    35x improvement over EC-HTE alone（0.178 → 0.005）是 dramatic 的，因为 EC-HTE 只修正  covariate-side\n604\t    error 而忽略 outcome-side error，在 DGP C 中 outcome error 贡献了大部分  残余 bias。PPCI alone\n605\t    的 bias 也很低（0.004）但 RMSE 更高（0.261 vs 0.225），因为 PPCI  rectifier 是 nonparametric\n606\t    的，不利用 mixing matrix structure，需要更多 gold labels  才能达到同样精度。DGP A 中 ec_hte_ppci =\n607\t    ec_hte（因为无 outcome error，PPCI rectifier  学到 identity correction），验证 composition\n608\t    不会在 pure covariate-error 场景下 hurt。 DSL per-subgroup 是 valid baseline 但缺少 cross-subgroup\n609\t    shrinkage，variance 高于 EC-HTE。\n610\t\n611\t    '\n612\t  tables:\n613\t  - name: 'Table 13: DGP C (Both Errors) Method Comparison'\n614\t    columns:\n615\t    - method\n616\t    - avg_abs_bias_z0\n617\t    - rmse_z0\n618\t    - coverage_z0\n619\t    key_rows:\n620\t    - - naive\n621\t      - 0.251\n622\t      - 0.269\n623\t      - 0.82\n624\t    - - global_corrected\n625\t      - 0.195\n626\t      - 0.245\n627\t      - 0.88\n628\t    - - ec_hte\n629\t      - 0.178\n630\t      - 0.226\n631\t      - 0.91\n632\t    - - ppci\n633\t      - 0.004\n634\t      - 0.261\n635\t      - 1.0\n636\t    - - ec_hte_ppci\n637\t      - 0.005\n638\t      - 0.225\n639\t      - 1.0\n640\t    - - dsl_per_subgroup\n641\t      - 0.16\n642\t      - 0.28\n643\t      - 0.9\n644\t  - name: 'Table 14: Cross-DGP Summary (n=250, K=2, extreme)'\n645\t    columns:\n646\t    - DGP\n647\t    - best_method_bias\n648\t    - best_method_rmse\n649\t    - ec_hte_ppci_rank\n650\t    key_rows:\n651\t    - - A_covariate_only\n652\t      - ec_hte\n653\t      - ec_hte\n654\t      - tied 1st\n655\t    - - B_outcome_only\n656\t      - ppci\n657\t      - ppci\n658\t      - tied 1st\n659\t    - - C_both_errors\n660\t      - ec_hte_ppci\n661\t      - ec_hte_ppci\n662\t      - 1st\n663\t    - - D_no_error\n664\t      - naive\n665\t      - naive\n666\t      - competitive\n667\t  figures_description:\n668\t  - '4-panel DGP comparison: bias bar charts for each DGP, methods as bars'\n669\t  - 'PPCI complementarity diagram: EC-HTE handles covariate error, PPCI handles outcome\n670\t    error'\n671\t  analysis: 'PPCI 互补性在 median 档下成为 key selling point。ec_hte_ppci 在 DGP C 中的 35x bias  reduction\n672\t    是论文中最 striking 的数字之一。Framing: \"EC-HTE and PPCI are empirically  necessary and\n673\t    sufficient in composition — neither alone handles dual-error scenarios,  but their\n674\t    composition reduces bias to near-zero.\" 这弥补了 EC-HTE 单独使用时 real data  不 conclusive\n675\t    的弱点：即使 EC-HTE 单独表现 modest，与 PPCI 组合后提供 complete 解决方案。\n676\t\n677\t    '\n678\t- name: Multiple LLM Annotator Comparison\n679\t  plan_id: exp-008\n680\t  description: 'GPT-3.5-turbo, GPT-4-turbo, GPT-4.1, GPT-4o, GPT-4o-mini, GPT-5.4  annotation\n681\t    on TweetEval sentiment。Heterogeneity across models and generations。\n682\t\n683\t    '\n684\t  expected_results:\n685\t    models_completed: 6\n686\t    all_effective_delta_pi_above_005: true\n687\t    effective_delta_pi:\n688\t      gpt-3.5-turbo: 0.198\n689\t      gpt-4-turbo: 0.149\n690\t      gpt-4.1: 0.098\n691\t      gpt-4o: 0.08\n692\t      gpt-4o-mini: 0.136\n693\t      gpt-5.4: 0.114\n694\t    worst_subgroup_consensus: True_medium (5/6 models)\n695\t    filtered_subgroups: 4\n696\t    structural_heterogeneity: true\n697\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 all 6 models show Δπ > 0.05（filter 掉 n<10 的 subgroups\n698\t    后），确认  misclassification heterogeneity 是 structural 而非 model-specific。GPT-3.5\n699\t    的 Δπ=0.198  最高（older model, more heterogeneous errors），GPT-4o 最低（0.080），但即使最新模型  GPT-5.4\n700\t    仍有 Δπ=0.114——模型质量提升减少了 overall error rate 但不消除 subgroup-level  heterogeneity。5/6\n701\t    models 共享 worst subgroup (True_medium) 说明 difficulty structure  是 text-intrinsic\n702\t    的，不随 model 改变。这支撑了论文的 motivation：即使 LLM 越来越好， subgroup-varying error 仍然存在，correction\n703\t    需求不会消失。但 limited statistical power  (only 4 subgroups after filtering) 限制了 cross-model\n704\t    correlation 分析的深度。\n705\t\n706\t    '\n707\t  tables:\n708\t  - name: 'Table 15: Cross-Model Δπ Summary'\n709\t    columns:\n710\t    - model\n711\t    - generation\n712\t    - overall_accuracy\n713\t    - effective_delta_pi\n714\t    - worst_subgroup\n715\t    key_rows:\n716\t    - - gpt-3.5-turbo\n717\t      - '3.5'\n718\t      - 0.72\n719\t      - 0.198\n720\t      - True_medium\n721\t    - - gpt-4-turbo\n722\t      - '4'\n723\t      - 0.81\n724\t      - 0.149\n725\t      - True_medium\n726\t    - - gpt-4.1\n727\t      - '4.1'\n728\t      - 0.86\n729\t      - 0.098\n730\t      - True_medium\n731\t    - - gpt-4o\n732\t      - 4o\n733\t      - 0.88\n734\t      - 0.08\n735\t      - False_medium\n736\t    - - gpt-4o-mini\n737\t      - 4o-mini\n738\t      - 0.83\n739\t      - 0.136\n740\t      - True_medium\n741\t    - - gpt-5.4\n742\t      - '5.4'\n743\t      - 0.9\n744\t      - 0.114\n745\t      - True_medium\n746\t  figures_description:\n747\t  - Model accuracy vs Δπ scatter plot with generation labels\n748\t  - Per-subgroup misclassification rate heatmap (models × subgroups)\n749\t  analysis: 'Multi-LLM 结果适合移至 appendix（Paper Framing 已建议 exp-008 to appendix），但核心  finding\n750\t    (heterogeneity is structural) 在 Introduction 中引用。Median 档下这个实验的主要  价值是 motivation\n751\t    strengthening，不是 method validation。\n752\t\n753\t    '\n754\t- name: Adaptive Expert Annotation Allocation\n755\t  plan_id: exp-009\n756\t  description: 'CATE-weighted allocation targeting high-CATE × high-error subgroups。\n757\t    Compare against uniform and uncertainty-only allocation。P2 priority。\n758\t\n759\t    '\n760\t  expected_results:\n761\t    allocation_strategies:\n762\t    - uniform\n763\t    - uncertainty_only\n764\t    - cate_weighted\n765\t    - cate_x_error\n766\t    n_expert_total:\n767\t    - 100\n768\t    - 250\n769\t    - 500\n770\t    K:\n771\t    - 2\n772\t    - 4\n773\t    regime:\n774\t    - extreme\n775\t    - moderate\n776\t    mc_runs: 100\n777\t    cate_weighted_rmse_improvement_vs_uniform:\n778\t      extreme_n250_k2: 8-12%\n779\t      extreme_n250_k4: 12-18%\n780\t      moderate_n250_k2: 3-5%\n781\t      moderate_n250_k4: 5-8%\n782\t    cate_x_error_rmse_improvement_vs_uniform:\n783\t      extreme_n250_k2: 10-15%\n784\t      extreme_n250_k4: 15-22%\n785\t    cate_weighted_vs_uniform_bias_improvement: marginal (<5%)\n786\t    key_finding: CATE×error allocation improves RMSE modestly but doesn't change crossover\n787\t      thresholds\n788\t    adaptive_crossover_shift: 50-100 labels earlier than uniform in K=2/extreme\n789\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 adaptive allocation 提供 modest improvement。CATE-weighted\n790\t    allocation 将更多  expert labels 分配给 high-CATE × high-error subgroups，在 K=4 场景下 RMSE\n791\t    改善 15-22% （因为 minority subgroups 同时是 high-error 和 high-CATE，uniform allocation\n792\t    严重  under-sample 它们）。但改善主要体现在 RMSE 而非 bias——因为 bias 取决于 CM estimation  accuracy\n793\t    而非 CM estimation precision，而 accuracy 在 unbiased estimator 下与 allocation  无关。在\n794\t    moderate regime 下改善更小（3-8%），因为 subgroup 间 error 和 CATE 差异本身就小。 Crossover threshold\n795\t    仅提前 50-100 labels（如 K=2/extreme 从 250 降至 ~175），不改变  order-of-magnitude 结论。这解释了为什么\n796\t    exp-009 是 P2——nice-to-have 的 optimization， 不是 core contribution。论文中可在 Discussion\n797\t    中 mention \"future work: adaptive allocation  can further improve efficiency\" 而不需要详细展示。\n798\t\n799\t    '\n800\t  tables:\n801\t  - name: 'Table 16: Allocation Strategy Comparison (K=4/extreme/n=250)'\n802\t    columns:\n803\t    - strategy\n804\t    - mean_rmse\n805\t    - mean_abs_bias\n806\t    - coverage\n807\t    - vs_uniform_rmse_pct\n808\t    key_rows:\n809\t    - - uniform\n810\t      - 0.89\n811\t      - 0.12\n812\t      - 0.92\n813\t      - baseline\n814\t    - - uncertainty_only\n815\t      - 0.82\n816\t      - 0.11\n817\t      - 0.92\n818\t      - +7.9%\n819\t    - - cate_weighted\n820\t      - 0.75\n821\t      - 0.11\n822\t      - 0.93\n823\t      - +15.7%\n824\t    - - cate_x_error\n825\t      - 0.71\n826\t      - 0.11\n827\t      - 0.93\n828\t      - +20.2%\n829\t  figures_description:\n830\t  - RMSE vs n_expert curves for each allocation strategy, K=4/extreme panel\n831\t  analysis: 'P2 实验，结论 modest。如论文 space 不足可完全省略或在 appendix 一段话提及。 Median 档下不需要此实验来支撑\n832\t    core claims。\n833\t\n834\t    '\n835\t- name: Robustness to Misspecified Subgroups\n836\t  plan_id: exp-010\n837\t  description: 'Subgroup label noise p_flip ∈ {0, 0.10, 0.25, 0.50}。 K=2 和 K=4 extreme。Coverage\n838\t    和 RMSE degradation analysis。\n839\t\n840\t    '\n841\t  expected_results:\n842\t    noise_levels:\n843\t    - 0\n844\t    - 0.1\n845\t    - 0.25\n846\t    - 0.5\n847\t    k2_coverage_hb:\n848\t    - 0.958\n849\t    - 0.948\n850\t    - 0.95\n851\t    - 0.945\n852\t    k4_coverage_hb:\n853\t    - 0.956\n854\t    - 0.958\n855\t    - 0.96\n856\t    - 0.946\n857\t    k2_coverage_naive:\n858\t    - 0.875\n859\t    - 0.877\n860\t    - 0.89\n861\t    - 0.897\n862\t    hb_beats_mle_all_configs: true\n863\t    hb_improvement_range: +0.1% to +0.9% RMSE vs MLE\n864\t    graceful_convergence_at_50pct: true\n865\t    no_catastrophic_failure: true\n866\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 robustness 结果是 positive 的——这是 EC-HTE 的 \"safety valve\"。HB\n867\t    partial  pooling 在 subgroup noise 增加时自动增大 concentration parameter，shrink toward\n868\t    global， 实现 graceful degradation。Coverage 从 0.956-0.958 (no noise) 仅降至 0.945-0.946  (50%\n869\t    noise)，远未 catastrophic。Naive coverage 反而随 noise 略升（0.875 → 0.897）， 因为 noise blurs\n870\t    subgroup-specific bias toward zero。\n871\t\n872\t    关键 insight：在 50% noise 下 HB ≈ MLE ≈ Global（subgroup structure 被完全破坏，所有  stratified\n873\t    methods 退化为 global），但 HB 的 automatic shrinkage 意味着用户无需手动检测  subgroup quality。这回应\n874\t    Reviewer Concern #4。Coverage 优势在所有 noise levels 下维持  (~95% vs naive ~87-92%)，强化了\n875\t    \"correction is essential for valid inference\" 的 message。\n876\t\n877\t    '\n878\t  tables:\n879\t  - name: 'Table 17: Coverage Across Noise Levels'\n880\t    columns:\n881\t    - K\n882\t    - p_flip\n883\t    - coverage_naive\n884\t    - coverage_global\n885\t    - coverage_hb\n886\t    key_rows:\n887\t    - - 2\n888\t      - 0.0\n889\t      - 0.875\n890\t      - 0.925\n891\t      - 0.958\n892\t    - - 2\n893\t      - 0.25\n894\t      - 0.89\n895\t      - 0.932\n896\t      - 0.95\n897\t    - - 2\n898\t      - 0.5\n899\t      - 0.897\n900\t      - 0.945\n901\t      - 0.945\n902\t    - - 4\n903\t      - 0.0\n904\t      - 0.904\n905\t      - 0.93\n906\t      - 0.956\n907\t    - - 4\n908\t      - 0.25\n909\t      - 0.909\n910\t      - 0.948\n911\t      - 0.96\n912\t    - - 4\n913\t      - 0.5\n914\t      - 0.919\n915\t      - 0.944\n916\t      - 0.946\n917\t  figures_description:\n918\t  - Coverage vs p_flip line plot, 3 methods, K=2 and K=4 panels\n919\t  - 'RMSE degradation curve: HB-Global RMSE gap vs p_flip'\n920\t  analysis: 'Robustness 是 Reviewer Concern #4 的直接回应。Median 档下结论 clean： EC-HTE 不会因\n921\t    subgroup misspecification 而 catastrophically fail，HB''s built-in  shrinkage 是\n922\t    automatic safeguard。Move to appendix if space tight（Paper Framing  建议 exp-010\n923\t    to appendix），main text 一段话 summarize key finding。\n924\t\n925\t    '\n926\t- name: Causal Forest Integration\n927\t  plan_id: exp-011\n928\t  description: 'CausalForestDML + EC-HTE post-hoc correction vs naive forest vs globally-corrected\n929\t    forest。 K={2,4} × regime={extreme,moderate} × n_expert={250,500}。\n930\t\n931\t    '\n932\t  expected_results:\n933\t    n_mc: 100\n934\t    n_configs: 8\n935\t    mean_abs_bias:\n936\t      naive_forest: 0.156\n937\t      global_forest: 0.107\n938\t      ec_hte_forest: 0.061\n939\t    mean_rmse:\n940\t      naive_forest: 0.178\n941\t      global_forest: 0.166\n942\t      ec_hte_forest: 0.229\n943\t    debiasing_hurts_max_ratio_cf: 5.9\n944\t    debiasing_hurts_detail: 'K=4/extreme/sg0: global 5.9x worse than naive'\n945\t    ec_hte_bias_reduction_vs_global: '2.5x (mean abs bias: 0.061 vs 0.107 → 1.75x;\n946\t      worst subgroup up to 3.0x)'\n947\t    k2_n500_ec_hte_bias: 0.004-0.013 (near zero)\n948\t    k2_n500_global_bias: 0.033-0.109 (still biased)\n949\t    rmse_tradeoff: ec_hte RMSE 38% higher than global (0.229 vs 0.166)\n950\t  result_rationale: 'CausalForest 放大了 debiasing-hurts 效应：K=4/extreme/sg0 达到 5.9x（落在\n951\t    median 范围  [5.0, 6.0] 内），远高于 DIM 的 2.4x。原因是 CausalForest 是 nonlinear CATE estimator，\n952\t    tree splits 在 misclassified observations 上创建 spurious heterogeneity，global correction  在\n953\t    tree-level 上 compound 了 per-observation 的 correction error。EC-HTE 的 bias reduction  factor\n954\t    2.5x（0.107 → 0.061，计算为 ~1.75x mean，worst subgroup 达 3.0x）落在 median  范围 [1.5, 3.0]\n955\t    内。\n956\t\n957\t    但 RMSE tradeoff 实质性：ec_hte RMSE 0.229 vs global 0.166 (+38%)。这是因为  CausalForest\n958\t    的 variance 本身就高（tree estimation uncertainty），per-subgroup CM  correction 进一步放大\n959\t    variance。K=2/n=500 时 EC-HTE bias 接近零 (0.004-0.013)  而 global 仍有显著 bias (0.033-0.109)，说明\n960\t    EC-HTE 在 sufficient data 条件下  确实解决了 problem。Pattern consistent with DIM：bias reduction\n961\t    confirmed，RMSE  tradeoff real，boundary conditions apply。\n962\t\n963\t    '\n964\t  tables:\n965\t  - name: 'Table 18: Causal Forest Method Comparison (Aggregate)'\n966\t    columns:\n967\t    - method\n968\t    - mean_abs_bias\n969\t    - mean_rmse\n970\t    - debiasing_hurts_cases\n971\t    key_rows:\n972\t    - - naive_forest\n973\t      - 0.156\n974\t      - 0.178\n975\t      - '-'\n976\t    - - global_forest\n977\t      - 0.107\n978\t      - 0.166\n979\t      - 9 configs (debiasing hurts)\n980\t    - - ec_hte_forest\n981\t      - 0.061\n982\t      - 0.229\n983\t      - '-'\n984\t  - name: 'Table 19: CausalForest Debiasing-Hurts Detail'\n985\t    columns:\n986\t    - K\n987\t    - regime\n988\t    - subgroup\n989\t    - naive_bias\n990\t    - global_bias\n991\t    - amplification\n992\t    key_rows:\n993\t    - - 4\n994\t      - extreme\n995\t      - sg0\n996\t      - 0.018\n997\t      - 0.106\n998\t      - 5.9x\n999\t    - - 4\n1000\t      - extreme\n1001\t      - sg1\n1002\t      - 0.045\n1003\t      - 0.089\n1004\t      - 2.0x\n1005\t    - - 2\n1006\t      - extreme\n1007\t      - sg0\n1008\t      - 0.033\n1009\t      - 0.109\n1010\t      - 3.3x\n1011\t  - name: 'Table 20: K=2/n=500 Detail (EC-HTE Sweet Spot)'\n1012\t    columns:\n1013\t    - method\n1014\t    - sg0_bias\n1015\t    - sg1_bias\n1016\t    - mean_rmse\n1017\t    key_rows:\n1018\t    - - naive_forest\n1019\t      - 0.08\n1020\t      - 0.12\n1021\t      - 0.15\n1022\t    - - global_forest\n1023\t      - 0.06\n1024\t      - 0.07\n1025\t      - 0.14\n1026\t    - - ec_hte_forest\n1027\t      - 0.004\n1028\t      - 0.013\n1029\t      - 0.16\n1030\t  figures_description:\n1031\t  - 'DIM vs CausalForest amplification comparison: paired bar chart showing K=4/extreme\n1032\t    amplification for both estimators'\n1033\t  - 'Bias-RMSE tradeoff scatter: each method as a point, showing EC-HTE''s Pareto\n1034\t    position'\n1035\t  analysis: 'CausalForest 实验填补了 Claim 2 的 evidence gap（claim 提到 CausalForestDML 但需要  实验验证）。Median\n1036\t    档下 pattern 与 DIM consistent 但 amplification 更极端（5.9x vs 2.4x）， 强化了 bias mechanism\n1037\t    的 practical severity。RMSE tradeoff (+38%) 必须诚实报告—— 这是 median 档 \"bias-RMSE tradeoff\"\n1038\t    disclosure 的 empirical basis。Paper 中需  bias-RMSE tradeoff figure showing EC-HTE\n1039\t    dominates on bias but not RMSE。 K-dependence 非单调模式（DIM: K=2 > K=4; CF: K=4 >>\n1040\t    K=2）必须分 estimator 报告， 不能简单说 \"more subgroups → worse\"。'\n1041\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b34b16e6-8f65-467e-98bb-d1dfe44324df","uuid":"f9262f41-e841-4e96-a819-2902bfcb4fba","timestamp":"2026-05-21T13:05:12.799Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520/projects/ec_hte_llm_annotation/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T122454/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Claim 1（bias identity）完全确认，升级为 primary contribution——R² 接近 1.0，debiasing-hurts\n  在 ~50% 参数空间成立， 独立于 EC-HTE 是否被采用均具价值。Claim 2（EC-HTE）成立但 boundary conditions 显著：RMSE\n  优势仅限 extreme  heterogeneity + n_expert/K ≥ 25-50；moderate regime 下 global 常优于 EC-HTE\n  on RMSE。Claim 3 从 diagnostic  criterion 降级为 diagnostic heuristic——setting-level\n  CV AUC 停留在 0.45-0.65，仅 subgroup-level 有预测力。 Real data illustrative 而非 conclusive：Δπ\n  存在但 EC-HTE 未胜出（高 FNR + 小 n_expert/subgroup）。 PPCI 互补性成为关键卖点弥补 EC-HTE 单独使用的局限。论文需调整\n  claims 强度但仍 EMNLP-competitive， 预期 1-2R 后 accept。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: HB EC-HTE Synthetic Validation\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: 'HB Dirichlet-prior confusion matrix estimator + partial pooling，3600\n    MC runs across  extreme/moderate/homogeneous × n_expert {50,100,250,500,1000,2000}\n    × K={2,4}。 与 MLE/Laplace 对比。全 MCMC 诊断 + hyperprior sensitivity。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    mcmc_rhat_max: 1.02\n    mcmc_ess_min: 150\n    mcmc_divergent: 0\n    runtime_min: 70\n    total_mc_runs: 3600\n    hb_vs_mle_rmse_improvement_k2_n50: 4-9%\n    hb_vs_mle_rmse_improvement_k2_n100: 1-2%\n    hb_vs_mle_rmse_improvement_k4_n50_moderate: 6-9%\n    hb_coverage_min: 0.87\n    hb_coverage_median: 0.93\n    k4_extreme_n50_blowup: false\n    k4_extreme_n50_note: singularity guard + 4-chain MCMC 后修复，但该配置仍不推荐\n    hyperprior_sensitivity_k2: <1%\n    hyperprior_sensitivity_k4: ~4-5%\n    rmse_penalty_k4_extreme_n50: 1.4-2.8x vs global (MLE blowup, HB 部分缓解)\n    rmse_penalty_k4_extreme_n100: ~1.2x vs global\n    hb_converges_to_mle_at: n≥1000 (<0.5% difference)\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 HB partial pooling 提供实质性但有条件的改进。K=2 场景下 HB 与 MLE 差异较小（1-9%），\n    因为只有 2 个 subgroup 可借鉴信息有限。K=4 场景下 HB 的 shrinkage 优势更明显（尤其 n=50 的  minority subgroup），因为有\n    4 个 subgroup 提供 cross-group 信息。但 K=4/extreme/n=50 配置中  n_expert/K=12.5 < 25 的\n    boundary condition 是真实的——per-subgroup CM 估计噪声过大，矩阵求逆  放大误差，导致 RMSE 恶化。4-chain\n    MCMC + singularity guard 消除数值灾难但不改变根本的统计限制。 Hyperprior 对 K=2 几乎无影响（只有 2 组，shrinkage\n    target 稳定），K=4 有 ~4-5% 变化但 coverage  不变，说明 HB 对先验规格稳健。整体结论：HB 在 n_expert/K ≥ 25\n    时安全推荐，低于此阈值需回退至  stratified MLE 或 global。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: HB vs MLE RMSE Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - K\n    - regime\n    - n_expert\n    - rmse_mle\n    - rmse_hb\n    - hb_improvement_pct\n    - coverage_hb\n    key_rows:\n    - - 2\n      - extreme\n      - 50\n      - 0.375\n      - 0.395\n      - -5.3%\n      - 0.87\n    - - 2\n      - extreme\n      - 250\n      - 0.126\n      - 0.125\n      - +0.8%\n      - 0.94\n    - - 4\n      - extreme\n      - 50\n      - 1.73\n      - 1.42\n      - +17.9%\n      - 0.88\n    - - 4\n      - extreme\n      - 250\n      - 0.88\n      - 0.89\n      - -1.1%\n      - 0.92\n    - - 4\n      - moderate\n      - 50\n      - 1.31\n      - 0.87\n      - +33.6%\n      - 0.9\n  - name: 'Table 2: Hyperprior Sensitivity (Gamma scale ×0.5 to ×2.0)'\n    columns:\n    - K\n    - scale_factor\n    - rmse_change\n    - coverage_change\n    key_rows:\n    - - 2\n      - 0.5-2.0\n      - <1%\n      - invariant\n    - - 4\n      - 0.5-2.0\n      - ~4-5%\n      - invariant\n  figures_description:\n  - HB vs MLE RMSE ratio heatmap across (K, n_expert, regime) grid\n  - 'Convergence plot: HB-MLE RMSE gap vs n_expert，showing approach to 0 at n≥1000'\n  analysis: 'HB 的核心价值在 median 档下被精确定位：它是 James-Stein shrinkage estimator，在 moderate\n    subgroup  count (K=4) 且 n_expert 中等 (100-500) 时提供最大边际收益。但它不是 \"never worse than\n    global\"—— 在 K=4/n≤100 时 RMSE 可比 global 差 1.2-3.5x。Paper 必须诚实报告此 tradeoff 并给出 per-subgroup  threshold\n    (n_expert/K ≥ 25)。\n\n    '\n- name: Bias Identity Verification\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: '解析推导 bias = f(Δπ, Δτ) product form，通过 systematic parameter grid MC\n    验证。 K=2 和 K=4 extension。Debiasing-hurts proposition 构造性证明。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    r2_k2: 0.993\n    r2_k4: 0.974\n    tightness_ratio_k2_median: 1.003\n    tightness_ratio_k4_median: 1.023\n    debiasing_hurts_pct: 50\n    debiasing_hurts_pct_detail: ~260/520 (排除 dc=0 rows)\n    max_bias_ratio_k2_dim: 2.8\n    max_bias_ratio_k4_dim: 2.4\n    debiasing_hurts_threshold_delta_misclass: 0.12\n    coverage_2se_k2: 0.95\n    coverage_2se_k4: 0.94\n    product_form_exact: true\n    a2_symmetric_required: false\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 bias identity 完全成立（这是 exact identity at population\n    level，不是 bound）。 K=2 的 R²=0.993 接近 1.0，剩余 ~0.7% 是 MC 有限样本噪声而非理论松弛。K=4 的 R²=0.974  略低，因为\n    4-subgroup 配置下 sum-of-products form 有更多交叉项，MC 估计方差更大，但仍确认  product structure。Debiasing-hurts\n    在 ~50% parameter space 成立是因为当 naive bias 本身很小 （Δτ≈0 或 misclassification 恰好 symmetric）时，global\n    correction 引入的 systematic shift  反而超过原始 bias。Max amplification K=2=2.8x > K=4=2.4x\n    对 DIM estimator 看似反直觉，但因为  K=2 extreme 配置中两个 subgroup 的 π 差距更大（如 0.25 vs 0.05），correction\n    的 over/under-shoot  更集中；K=4 时 π 值更分散，极端 mismatch 被平均化。这个 K-dependence 非单调模式是 DIM-specific  的——CausalForest\n    中 K=4 amplification 更高（exp-011）。Product form 在 asymmetric misclassification  下仍然精确成立（A2\n    not required），由 exp-014 补充验证。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: Bias Identity R² Verification'\n    columns:\n    - K\n    - R2\n    - tightness_ratio_median\n    - tightness_ratio_95th\n    - coverage_2SE\n    key_rows:\n    - - 2\n      - 0.993\n      - 1.003\n      - 1.015\n      - 0.95\n    - - 4\n      - 0.974\n      - 1.023\n      - 1.065\n      - 0.94\n  - name: 'Table 4: Debiasing-Hurts Summary'\n    columns:\n    - K\n    - total_configs\n    - debiasing_hurts_count\n    - pct\n    - max_amplification\n    - threshold_Δπ\n    key_rows:\n    - - 2\n      - 260\n      - ~130\n      - ~50%\n      - 2.8\n      - 0.12\n    - - 4\n      - 260\n      - ~130\n      - ~50%\n      - 2.4\n      - 0.12\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bias amplification heatmap: Δπ (x-axis) vs Δτ (y-axis), color = bias ratio (global/naive).\n    Paper Figure 2.'\n  - 'Scatter: analytic prediction vs MC bias, K=2 and K=4 panels, with R² annotation'\n  analysis: 'Bias identity 是本文 primary contribution。Median 档下完全确认：population-level\n    exact identity  在有限样本中 R²>0.97。Debiasing-hurts 50% 的比例足够 dramatic 支撑 Claim 1 的\n    practical relevance。 max amplification 2.4-2.8x (DIM) 在 median 范围内，足以引起审稿人注意但不会被质疑为\n    cherry-picked  extreme case。此 claim 独立于 EC-HTE 是否被采用——即使读者不使用 EC-HTE，knowing when\n    global  correction backfires 本身就是 actionable 的。\n\n    '\n- name: Semi-Synthetic CSS Benchmark\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: 'TweetEval sentiment (N=45K) 上注入 CATE heterogeneity，GPT-4.1 annotation，\n    K=4 subgroups (text features)，100 MC runs，全方法对比。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_subgroups: 4\n    misclass_rates: S0=0.05, S1=0.10, S2=0.15, S3=0.25\n    p_z1_actual: 0.39\n    delta_pi: 0.2\n    debiasing_hurts_confirmed: true\n    mc_runs: 100\n    hb_vs_mle_n100_S3_extreme: +50-60% RMSE (HB dramatically better)\n    hb_vs_mle_n50_S3_extreme: -50-60% RMSE (HB worse, boundary condition)\n    hb_vs_mle_n250_all: +5-17% RMSE (HB modestly better)\n    hb_boundary_condition: n_expert≥100 recommended; n=50 with extreme heterogeneity\n      in minority subgroups degrades\n    coverage_hb_median: 0.93\n    coverage_naive_median: 0.87\n  result_rationale: 'Semi-synthetic DGP 用真实 text features 构造 4 subgroups，misclassification\n    rates 从 5% 到 25%  跨越 5 倍差距（Δπ=0.20），这足以触发 debiasing-hurts。S3 是 minority subgroup\n    (~12% 样本) 且  misclass rate 最高 (25%)，是 correction 最需要但也最困难的对象。n=50 时 S3 只有 ~6 个\n    expert  labels（50×12%），HB posterior 被先验主导，correction 噪声大于信号——这是 median 档的核心 boundary  condition。n=100\n    时 S3 有 ~12 个 expert labels，刚过 HB crossover 阈值，partial pooling 开始  生效，HB 显著优于 MLE（+50-60%）因为\n    MLE 在这么少样本上完全不稳定。n≥250 时两者收敛。 Coverage 是关键区分指标：naive ~87% 系统性低于 nominal 95%（因\n    misclassification bias 未被 CI 覆盖）， HB ~93% 接近但未完全达到 nominal（因 finite-sample CM\n    估计不确定性）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5: Semi-Synthetic Results by Method and n_expert'\n    columns:\n    - n_expert\n    - method\n    - mean_abs_bias\n    - rmse\n    - coverage\n    key_rows:\n    - - 100\n      - oracle\n      - 0.01\n      - 0.05\n      - 0.96\n    - - 100\n      - naive\n      - 0.06\n      - 0.08\n      - 0.87\n    - - 100\n      - global_corrected\n      - 0.04\n      - 0.09\n      - 0.92\n    - - 100\n      - mle_stratified\n      - 0.03\n      - 0.1\n      - 0.94\n    - - 100\n      - hb_ec_hte\n      - 0.02\n      - 0.09\n      - 0.93\n    - - 50\n      - hb_ec_hte\n      - 0.04\n      - 0.14\n      - 0.9\n    - - 250\n      - hb_ec_hte\n      - 0.01\n      - 0.07\n      - 0.95\n  - name: 'Table 6: S3 (Minority Subgroup) Detail'\n    columns:\n    - n_expert\n    - method\n    - S3_rmse\n    - S3_coverage\n    key_rows:\n    - - 50\n      - mle_stratified\n      - 0.35\n      - 0.88\n    - - 50\n      - hb_ec_hte\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.87\n    - - 100\n      - mle_stratified\n      - 0.18\n      - 0.91\n    - - 100\n      - hb_ec_hte\n      - 0.07\n      - 0.94\n  figures_description:\n  - Per-subgroup RMSE curves vs n_expert for HB vs MLE vs Global, highlighting S3\n    crossover\n  - 'Coverage calibration plot: nominal vs empirical coverage across methods'\n  analysis: 'Semi-synthetic 验证了 median 档的核心叙事：EC-HTE 在 extreme heterogeneity 下有效，但受\n    n_expert/K  约束显著。S3 的 dramatic crossover（n=50 HB 差，n=100 HB 好）是论文中 \"When NOT to\n    use EC-HTE\"  小节的 empirical basis。Coverage 优势比 RMSE 优势更稳健——即使在 RMSE 略差的配置下，HB 的\n    coverage  仍接近 nominal。\n\n    '\n- name: Real-Data Case Study (Pattern Consistency)\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: 'UC Berkeley Measuring Hate Speech corpus，GPT-4.1 annotation， text-feature\n    subgroups (platform × text_length)，bootstrap CIs。 Illustrative application, NOT\n    ground-truth benchmark。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    dataset: UC Berkeley Measuring Hate Speech\n    n_comments: 2496\n    subgroup_type: platform_group × text_length\n    delta_pi: 0.117\n    global_FPR: 0.14\n    global_FNR: 0.53\n    avg_abs_bias_naive: 0.21\n    avg_abs_bias_global: 0.273\n    avg_abs_bias_ec_hte: 0.313\n    ec_hte_vs_global_bias_diff: 0.04\n    cate_comparison: inconclusive — EC-HTE does not outperform global\n    bootstrap_ci_width: wide, overlapping\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 real data 是 illustrative 而非 conclusive。ec_hte_vs_global\n    bias diff = +0.04  落在 median 范围 [-0.05, 0.05] 内，意味着统计上无法区分。根本原因有三：(1) Global FNR=53%  说明\n    GPT-4.1 严重低估 dehumanization（超过一半的正例被漏掉），导致 confusion matrix 高度不对称， correction\n    的 signal-to-noise ratio 低；(2) Δπ=0.117 虽然统计显著但绝对值不大——4 个 subgroup  的 misclass\n    rate 从 0.266 到 0.383，跨度有限，EC-HTE 相对于 global 的边际收益小；(3) 2496  comments / 4 subgroups\n    / bootstrap splitting 后 per-subgroup n_expert 不足，CM 估计噪声大。 这恰好印证了 Claim 2 的 boundary\n    condition 和 Claim 3 的降级——在 moderate heterogeneity +  limited expert labels 的真实条件下，EC-HTE\n    的优势不 manifest。论文中将此 framing 为  \"heterogeneity 存在且结构性（支持 Claim 1），但 EC-HTE 需要更强的条件才能\n    outperform（支持  Claim 2 的 boundary 叙事）\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 7: Real-Data CATE Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - avg_abs_bias\n    - bootstrap_95CI\n    - interpretation\n    key_rows:\n    - - naive\n      - 0.21\n      - '[0.15, 0.27]'\n      - baseline\n    - - global_corrected\n      - 0.273\n      - '[0.20, 0.35]'\n      - over-correction due to high FNR\n    - - ec_hte\n      - 0.313\n      - '[0.22, 0.40]'\n      - additional noise from subgroup CM estimation\n  - name: 'Table 8: Subgroup Misclassification Rates'\n    columns:\n    - subgroup\n    - n\n    - misclass_rate\n    - FPR\n    - FNR\n    key_rows:\n    - - plat0_long\n      - 624\n      - 0.266\n      - 0.1\n      - 0.55\n    - - plat0_short\n      - 624\n      - 0.337\n      - 0.15\n      - 0.58\n    - - plat23_long\n      - 624\n      - 0.303\n      - 0.12\n      - 0.52\n    - - plat23_short\n      - 624\n      - 0.383\n      - 0.18\n      - 0.5\n  figures_description:\n  - Subgroup-level CATE point estimates with bootstrap CIs, three methods side by\n    side\n  - Misclassification rate bar chart across subgroups with error bars\n  analysis: 'Real data 结果精确匹配 median 档预期：heterogeneity 存在但 EC-HTE 无法 outperform。这不是  method\n    failure 而是 operating condition mismatch——FNR=53% 是极端不对称，Δπ=0.117 是 moderate  heterogeneity，per-subgroup\n    expert labels 不足。论文将此缩短为 illustrative application， 着重展示 (a) heterogeneity 是结构性的（支持\n    Claim 1 的 real-world relevance），(b) EC-HTE  需要更好的条件才能发挥优势（honest disclosure strengthens\n    credibility）。\n\n    '\n- name: Diagnostic Criterion Validation\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: 'Δπ × Δτ product 从 pilot data 计算，across 全部实验 settings， leave-one-setting-out\n    CV evaluation，ROC analysis。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    diagnostic_auc_cv_setting_level: 0.49\n    diagnostic_auc_subgroup_level: 0.833\n    subgroup_correlation_pi_vs_bias_direction: 0.86\n    low_pi_hurt_pct: 84.6\n    high_pi_hurt_pct: 15.4\n    theory_alignment: consistent with exp-002 formula\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档的 defining feature 是 Claim 3 降级为 heuristic。Setting-level\n    CV AUC=0.49  实质等于随机猜测——这是因为 setting-level 的 \"debiasing hurts\" 判定取决于所有 subgroup\n    的  aggregate，而 aggregate 受 subgroup 权重、CATE 方向、和 misclass 分布的复杂交互影响， 单一 Δπ×Δτ\n    product 无法 capture 这些 higher-order effects。具体来说，setting A 中  debiasing 可能 hurt\n    subgroup 0 但 help subgroup 1，net effect 取决于 subgroup size ratio  ——这是 product\n    form 理论上 exact 但 empirically 在 setting level 预测力弱的原因。 Subgroup-level AUC=0.833\n    仍有价值：在 subgroup 粒度上，Δπ 大的 subgroup 有 84.6% 概率  被 debiasing 伤害（vs 15.4% for low\n    Δπ），这与 bias identity 完全一致。但 0.833 不够  支撑独立 claim——false positive rate ~15% 意味着每\n    ~7 个标记中有 1 个误报。 降级路径：Claim 3 从 \"diagnostic criterion (决策工具)\" 重写为 \"diagnostic heuristic  (标记\n    subgroup-level risk 的工具)\"，用于与 budget analysis (exp-006) 联合决策。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 9: Diagnostic Performance Summary'\n    columns:\n    - level\n    - AUC\n    - sensitivity\n    - specificity\n    - interpretation\n    key_rows:\n    - - setting_level_cv\n      - 0.49\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.48\n      - no better than chance\n    - - subgroup_level\n      - 0.833\n      - 0.85\n      - 0.75\n      - useful heuristic, not reliable criterion\n  - name: 'Table 10: Subgroup-Level Diagnostic Breakdown'\n    columns:\n    - pi_category\n    - n_subgroups\n    - hurt_pct\n    - not_hurt_pct\n    key_rows:\n    - - high_pi\n      - 26\n      - 84.6%\n      - 15.4%\n    - - low_pi\n      - 26\n      - 15.4%\n      - 84.6%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'ROC curve: subgroup-level prediction, with AUC annotation and diagonal reference.\n    Paper Figure 3.'\n  - 'Calibration plot: predicted probability of debiasing-hurts vs observed frequency'\n  analysis: 'Setting-level AUC=0.49 是 median 档最大的单点弱化。审稿人会质疑 \"why call it a diagnostic  if\n    it can''t predict at the analysis level?\" Rebuttal strategy: (1) reframe as subgroup-level  heuristic\n    (AUC=0.83)，(2) argue subgroup-level is the actionable granularity for EC-HTE  决策，(3)\n    connect to budget recommendation——diagnostic flags which subgroups need stratified  correction,\n    budget analysis determines whether you can afford it. 这个 three-legged stool  (Claim\n    1 identifies problem, Claim 3 flags risk subgroups, exp-006 determines budget)  是\n    median 档的核心 defense strategy。\n\n    '\n- name: Expert Label Budget Sensitivity\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: 'Systematic sweep n_expert ∈ {50,100,250,500,1000,2000} × K ∈ {2,4}\n    × regime ∈ {extreme,moderate}。 Find RMSE crossover points where HB > Global。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_mc: 100\n    total_rows: 288\n    crossover_hb_beats_global:\n      K2_extreme: 250\n      K2_moderate: never (global always better on RMSE)\n      K4_extreme: 1000\n      K4_moderate: 2000\n    hb_vs_mle_pct_better: 87.5% (21/24 configs)\n    hb_best_improvement_over_mle_k4_moderate_n50: +42%\n    hb_convergence_to_mle: n≥1000 (<0.5%)\n    rmse_penalty_k4_extreme_n50: 4.8x vs global\n    rmse_penalty_k4_extreme_n100: 4.0x vs global\n    rmse_penalty_k4_extreme_n250: 3.1x vs global\n    rmse_penalty_k4_moderate_n50: 5.0x vs global\n  result_rationale: 'Crossover thresholds 是 Claim 2 boundary conditions 的量化核心。K=2/extreme\n    在 n=250 crossover  是因为只需要估计 2 个 2×2 confusion matrices (8 参数)，n=250 提供 ~125 labels/subgroup，足以  精确估计。K=4/extreme\n    需要估计 4 个 2×2 CM (16 参数) 且 minority subgroups 只占 ~12%， n=1000 时 minority 有 ~120\n    labels 才够。K=4/moderate 在 n=2000 crossover 因为 moderate  heterogeneity 下 EC-HTE\n    的 bias reduction 边际收益小（Δπ 只有 ~0.10），需要极其精确的 CM  估计才能在 RMSE 上胜过 global 的低方差。K=2/moderate\n    never crosses 因为 Δπ 太小， stratified correction 永远无法在 bias reduction 上弥补增加的方差。\n\n    RMSE penalty 在小 n 时达到 1.2-3.5x (median 范围)，最极端可达 ~5x。这是因为 K=4/n=50 时  minority\n    subgroup 仅 ~6 labels，CM 行之和约束下有效自由度极低，矩阵求逆放大估计噪声。 HB 相比 MLE 在 87.5% 配置中更好，主要贡献在\n    small-n minority subgroups (partial pooling  borrowing from majority subgroups)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 11: RMSE Crossover Summary'\n    columns:\n    - K\n    - regime\n    - crossover_n_expert\n    - interpretation\n    key_rows:\n    - - 2\n      - extreme\n      - 250\n      - practical — 250 expert labels feasible\n    - - 2\n      - moderate\n      - never\n      - global correction sufficient\n    - - 4\n      - extreme\n      - 1000\n      - higher bar — 1000 labels needed\n    - - 4\n      - moderate\n      - 2000\n      - marginal case — cost-benefit questionable\n  - name: 'Table 12: RMSE Penalty at Small n'\n    columns:\n    - K\n    - regime\n    - n_expert\n    - rmse_hb\n    - rmse_global\n    - penalty_ratio\n    key_rows:\n    - - 4\n      - extreme\n      - 50\n      - 1.42\n      - 0.29\n      - 4.9x\n    - - 4\n      - extreme\n      - 100\n      - 1.15\n      - 0.29\n      - 4.0x\n    - - 4\n      - extreme\n      - 250\n      - 0.89\n      - 0.29\n      - 3.1x\n    - - 4\n      - moderate\n      - 50\n      - 0.87\n      - 0.18\n      - 4.9x\n    - - 2\n      - extreme\n      - 50\n      - 0.4\n      - 0.14\n      - 2.8x\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Budget crossover curves: RMSE vs n_expert for HB vs Global, 4 panels (K×regime).\n    Paper Figure 4.'\n  - 'Heatmap: HB-Global RMSE ratio across (K, n_expert, regime) grid, red=HB worse,\n    blue=HB better'\n  analysis: 'Budget sensitivity 是 median 档论文的 \"Expert Budget Recommendation\" 小节的 empirical\n    basis。 Key message: K=2/extreme 在 n=250 crossover（实际可行），K=4/extreme 需 n=1000（较高但  可行），K=2/moderate\n    和 K=4/moderate 的 crossover 很晚或不存在（global is fine）。 这直接连接到 Claim 3：diagnostic heuristic\n    标记 extreme heterogeneity 的 subgroups， budget analysis 确定是否值得投资 stratified correction。Honest\n    framing: \"when the diagnostic  flags high heterogeneity, EC-HTE is worth the investment;\n    when heterogeneity is low, global  correction is the safer and cheaper choice.\"\n\n    '\n- name: PPCI + DSL Baseline Comparison\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: '4 DGPs (covariate-only / outcome-only / both / no-error) × 8 methods\n    × 100 MC。 EC-HTE+PPCI composition for dual error。Pure covariate-error control\n    condition。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_rows: 6912\n    dgps:\n    - A_covariate_only\n    - B_outcome_only\n    - C_both_errors\n    - D_no_error\n    methods: 8\n    dgp_c_extreme_n250_k2:\n      ec_hte_ppci_bias_z0: 0.005\n      ec_hte_ppci_rmse_z0: 0.225\n      ec_hte_bias_z0: 0.178\n      ppci_bias_z0: 0.004\n      ppci_rmse_z0: 0.261\n      naive_bias_z0: 0.251\n    dgp_a_ec_hte_ppci_equals_ec_hte: true\n    ec_hte_ppci_bias_reduction_vs_ec_hte_alone: 35x in DGP C\n    ppci_higher_variance: true\n    dsl_per_subgroup_valid_but_higher_variance: true\n  result_rationale: 'DGP C (both errors) 是 PPCI 互补性的关键测试场。ec_hte_ppci bias=0.005 落在\n    median 范围  [0.003, 0.015] 内——near-zero 但非 exact zero，因为 PPCI rectifier 在有限样本上有残余误差。\n    35x improvement over EC-HTE alone（0.178 → 0.005）是 dramatic 的，因为 EC-HTE 只修正  covariate-side\n    error 而忽略 outcome-side error，在 DGP C 中 outcome error 贡献了大部分  残余 bias。PPCI alone\n    的 bias 也很低（0.004）但 RMSE 更高（0.261 vs 0.225），因为 PPCI  rectifier 是 nonparametric\n    的，不利用 mixing matrix structure，需要更多 gold labels  才能达到同样精度。DGP A 中 ec_hte_ppci =\n    ec_hte（因为无 outcome error，PPCI rectifier  学到 identity correction），验证 composition\n    不会在 pure covariate-error 场景下 hurt。 DSL per-subgroup 是 valid baseline 但缺少 cross-subgroup\n    shrinkage，variance 高于 EC-HTE。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 13: DGP C (Both Errors) Method Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - avg_abs_bias_z0\n    - rmse_z0\n    - coverage_z0\n    key_rows:\n    - - naive\n      - 0.251\n      - 0.269\n      - 0.82\n    - - global_corrected\n      - 0.195\n      - 0.245\n      - 0.88\n    - - ec_hte\n      - 0.178\n      - 0.226\n      - 0.91\n    - - ppci\n      - 0.004\n      - 0.261\n      - 1.0\n    - - ec_hte_ppci\n      - 0.005\n      - 0.225\n      - 1.0\n    - - dsl_per_subgroup\n      - 0.16\n      - 0.28\n      - 0.9\n  - name: 'Table 14: Cross-DGP Summary (n=250, K=2, extreme)'\n    columns:\n    - DGP\n    - best_method_bias\n    - best_method_rmse\n    - ec_hte_ppci_rank\n    key_rows:\n    - - A_covariate_only\n      - ec_hte\n      - ec_hte\n      - tied 1st\n    - - B_outcome_only\n      - ppci\n      - ppci\n      - tied 1st\n    - - C_both_errors\n      - ec_hte_ppci\n      - ec_hte_ppci\n      - 1st\n    - - D_no_error\n      - naive\n      - naive\n      - competitive\n  figures_description:\n  - '4-panel DGP comparison: bias bar charts for each DGP, methods as bars'\n  - 'PPCI complementarity diagram: EC-HTE handles covariate error, PPCI handles outcome\n    error'\n  analysis: 'PPCI 互补性在 median 档下成为 key selling point。ec_hte_ppci 在 DGP C 中的 35x bias  reduction\n    是论文中最 striking 的数字之一。Framing: \"EC-HTE and PPCI are empirically  necessary and\n    sufficient in composition — neither alone handles dual-error scenarios,  but their\n    composition reduces bias to near-zero.\" 这弥补了 EC-HTE 单独使用时 real data  不 conclusive\n    的弱点：即使 EC-HTE 单独表现 modest，与 PPCI 组合后提供 complete 解决方案。\n\n    '\n- name: Multiple LLM Annotator Comparison\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: 'GPT-3.5-turbo, GPT-4-turbo, GPT-4.1, GPT-4o, GPT-4o-mini, GPT-5.4  annotation\n    on TweetEval sentiment。Heterogeneity across models and generations。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    models_completed: 6\n    all_effective_delta_pi_above_005: true\n    effective_delta_pi:\n      gpt-3.5-turbo: 0.198\n      gpt-4-turbo: 0.149\n      gpt-4.1: 0.098\n      gpt-4o: 0.08\n      gpt-4o-mini: 0.136\n      gpt-5.4: 0.114\n    worst_subgroup_consensus: True_medium (5/6 models)\n    filtered_subgroups: 4\n    structural_heterogeneity: true\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 all 6 models show Δπ > 0.05（filter 掉 n<10 的 subgroups\n    后），确认  misclassification heterogeneity 是 structural 而非 model-specific。GPT-3.5\n    的 Δπ=0.198  最高（older model, more heterogeneous errors），GPT-4o 最低（0.080），但即使最新模型  GPT-5.4\n    仍有 Δπ=0.114——模型质量提升减少了 overall error rate 但不消除 subgroup-level  heterogeneity。5/6\n    models 共享 worst subgroup (True_medium) 说明 difficulty structure  是 text-intrinsic\n    的，不随 model 改变。这支撑了论文的 motivation：即使 LLM 越来越好， subgroup-varying error 仍然存在，correction\n    需求不会消失。但 limited statistical power  (only 4 subgroups after filtering) 限制了 cross-model\n    correlation 分析的深度。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 15: Cross-Model Δπ Summary'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - generation\n    - overall_accuracy\n    - effective_delta_pi\n    - worst_subgroup\n    key_rows:\n    - - gpt-3.5-turbo\n      - '3.5'\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.198\n      - True_medium\n    - - gpt-4-turbo\n      - '4'\n      - 0.81\n      - 0.149\n      - True_medium\n    - - gpt-4.1\n      - '4.1'\n      - 0.86\n      - 0.098\n      - True_medium\n    - - gpt-4o\n      - 4o\n      - 0.88\n      - 0.08\n      - False_medium\n    - - gpt-4o-mini\n      - 4o-mini\n      - 0.83\n      - 0.136\n      - True_medium\n    - - gpt-5.4\n      - '5.4'\n      - 0.9\n      - 0.114\n      - True_medium\n  figures_description:\n  - Model accuracy vs Δπ scatter plot with generation labels\n  - Per-subgroup misclassification rate heatmap (models × subgroups)\n  analysis: 'Multi-LLM 结果适合移至 appendix（Paper Framing 已建议 exp-008 to appendix），但核心  finding\n    (heterogeneity is structural) 在 Introduction 中引用。Median 档下这个实验的主要  价值是 motivation\n    strengthening，不是 method validation。\n\n    '\n- name: Adaptive Expert Annotation Allocation\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: 'CATE-weighted allocation targeting high-CATE × high-error subgroups。\n    Compare against uniform and uncertainty-only allocation。P2 priority。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    allocation_strategies:\n    - uniform\n    - uncertainty_only\n    - cate_weighted\n    - cate_x_error\n    n_expert_total:\n    - 100\n    - 250\n    - 500\n    K:\n    - 2\n    - 4\n    regime:\n    - extreme\n    - moderate\n    mc_runs: 100\n    cate_weighted_rmse_improvement_vs_uniform:\n      extreme_n250_k2: 8-12%\n      extreme_n250_k4: 12-18%\n      moderate_n250_k2: 3-5%\n      moderate_n250_k4: 5-8%\n    cate_x_error_rmse_improvement_vs_uniform:\n      extreme_n250_k2: 10-15%\n      extreme_n250_k4: 15-22%\n    cate_weighted_vs_uniform_bias_improvement: marginal (<5%)\n    key_finding: CATE×error allocation improves RMSE modestly but doesn't change crossover\n      thresholds\n    adaptive_crossover_shift: 50-100 labels earlier than uniform in K=2/extreme\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 adaptive allocation 提供 modest improvement。CATE-weighted\n    allocation 将更多  expert labels 分配给 high-CATE × high-error subgroups，在 K=4 场景下 RMSE\n    改善 15-22% （因为 minority subgroups 同时是 high-error 和 high-CATE，uniform allocation\n    严重  under-sample 它们）。但改善主要体现在 RMSE 而非 bias——因为 bias 取决于 CM estimation  accuracy\n    而非 CM estimation precision，而 accuracy 在 unbiased estimator 下与 allocation  无关。在\n    moderate regime 下改善更小（3-8%），因为 subgroup 间 error 和 CATE 差异本身就小。 Crossover threshold\n    仅提前 50-100 labels（如 K=2/extreme 从 250 降至 ~175），不改变  order-of-magnitude 结论。这解释了为什么\n    exp-009 是 P2——nice-to-have 的 optimization， 不是 core contribution。论文中可在 Discussion\n    中 mention \"future work: adaptive allocation  can further improve efficiency\" 而不需要详细展示。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 16: Allocation Strategy Comparison (K=4/extreme/n=250)'\n    columns:\n    - strategy\n    - mean_rmse\n    - mean_abs_bias\n    - coverage\n    - vs_uniform_rmse_pct\n    key_rows:\n    - - uniform\n      - 0.89\n      - 0.12\n      - 0.92\n      - baseline\n    - - uncertainty_only\n      - 0.82\n      - 0.11\n      - 0.92\n      - +7.9%\n    - - cate_weighted\n      - 0.75\n      - 0.11\n      - 0.93\n      - +15.7%\n    - - cate_x_error\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.11\n      - 0.93\n      - +20.2%\n  figures_description:\n  - RMSE vs n_expert curves for each allocation strategy, K=4/extreme panel\n  analysis: 'P2 实验，结论 modest。如论文 space 不足可完全省略或在 appendix 一段话提及。 Median 档下不需要此实验来支撑\n    core claims。\n\n    '\n- name: Robustness to Misspecified Subgroups\n  plan_id: exp-010\n  description: 'Subgroup label noise p_flip ∈ {0, 0.10, 0.25, 0.50}。 K=2 和 K=4 extreme。Coverage\n    和 RMSE degradation analysis。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    noise_levels:\n    - 0\n    - 0.1\n    - 0.25\n    - 0.5\n    k2_coverage_hb:\n    - 0.958\n    - 0.948\n    - 0.95\n    - 0.945\n    k4_coverage_hb:\n    - 0.956\n    - 0.958\n    - 0.96\n    - 0.946\n    k2_coverage_naive:\n    - 0.875\n    - 0.877\n    - 0.89\n    - 0.897\n    hb_beats_mle_all_configs: true\n    hb_improvement_range: +0.1% to +0.9% RMSE vs MLE\n    graceful_convergence_at_50pct: true\n    no_catastrophic_failure: true\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 robustness 结果是 positive 的——这是 EC-HTE 的 \"safety valve\"。HB\n    partial  pooling 在 subgroup noise 增加时自动增大 concentration parameter，shrink toward\n    global， 实现 graceful degradation。Coverage 从 0.956-0.958 (no noise) 仅降至 0.945-0.946  (50%\n    noise)，远未 catastrophic。Naive coverage 反而随 noise 略升（0.875 → 0.897）， 因为 noise blurs\n    subgroup-specific bias toward zero。\n\n    关键 insight：在 50% noise 下 HB ≈ MLE ≈ Global（subgroup structure 被完全破坏，所有  stratified\n    methods 退化为 global），但 HB 的 automatic shrinkage 意味着用户无需手动检测  subgroup quality。这回应\n    Reviewer Concern #4。Coverage 优势在所有 noise levels 下维持  (~95% vs naive ~87-92%)，强化了\n    \"correction is essential for valid inference\" 的 message。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 17: Coverage Across Noise Levels'\n    columns:\n    - K\n    - p_flip\n    - coverage_naive\n    - coverage_global\n    - coverage_hb\n    key_rows:\n    - - 2\n      - 0.0\n      - 0.875\n      - 0.925\n      - 0.958\n    - - 2\n      - 0.25\n      - 0.89\n      - 0.932\n      - 0.95\n    - - 2\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.897\n      - 0.945\n      - 0.945\n    - - 4\n      - 0.0\n      - 0.904\n      - 0.93\n      - 0.956\n    - - 4\n      - 0.25\n      - 0.909\n      - 0.948\n      - 0.96\n    - - 4\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.919\n      - 0.944\n      - 0.946\n  figures_description:\n  - Coverage vs p_flip line plot, 3 methods, K=2 and K=4 panels\n  - 'RMSE degradation curve: HB-Global RMSE gap vs p_flip'\n  analysis: 'Robustness 是 Reviewer Concern #4 的直接回应。Median 档下结论 clean： EC-HTE 不会因\n    subgroup misspecification 而 catastrophically fail，HB''s built-in  shrinkage 是\n    automatic safeguard。Move to appendix if space tight（Paper Framing  建议 exp-010\n    to appendix），main text 一段话 summarize key finding。\n\n    '\n- name: Causal Forest Integration\n  plan_id: exp-011\n  description: 'CausalForestDML + EC-HTE post-hoc correction vs naive forest vs globally-corrected\n    forest。 K={2,4} × regime={extreme,moderate} × n_expert={250,500}。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_mc: 100\n    n_configs: 8\n    mean_abs_bias:\n      naive_forest: 0.156\n      global_forest: 0.107\n      ec_hte_forest: 0.061\n    mean_rmse:\n      naive_forest: 0.178\n      global_forest: 0.166\n      ec_hte_forest: 0.229\n    debiasing_hurts_max_ratio_cf: 5.9\n    debiasing_hurts_detail: 'K=4/extreme/sg0: global 5.9x worse than naive'\n    ec_hte_bias_reduction_vs_global: '2.5x (mean abs bias: 0.061 vs 0.107 → 1.75x;\n      worst subgroup up to 3.0x)'\n    k2_n500_ec_hte_bias: 0.004-0.013 (near zero)\n    k2_n500_global_bias: 0.033-0.109 (still biased)\n    rmse_tradeoff: ec_hte RMSE 38% higher than global (0.229 vs 0.166)\n  result_rationale: 'CausalForest 放大了 debiasing-hurts 效应：K=4/extreme/sg0 达到 5.9x（落在\n    median 范围  [5.0, 6.0] 内），远高于 DIM 的 2.4x。原因是 CausalForest 是 nonlinear CATE estimator，\n    tree splits 在 misclassified observations 上创建 spurious heterogeneity，global correction  在\n    tree-level 上 compound 了 per-observation 的 correction error。EC-HTE 的 bias reduction  factor\n    2.5x（0.107 → 0.061，计算为 ~1.75x mean，worst subgroup 达 3.0x）落在 median  范围 [1.5, 3.0]\n    内。\n\n    但 RMSE tradeoff 实质性：ec_hte RMSE 0.229 vs global 0.166 (+38%)。这是因为  CausalForest\n    的 variance 本身就高（tree estimation uncertainty），per-subgroup CM  correction 进一步放大\n    variance。K=2/n=500 时 EC-HTE bias 接近零 (0.004-0.013)  而 global 仍有显著 bias (0.033-0.109)，说明\n    EC-HTE 在 sufficient data 条件下  确实解决了 problem。Pattern consistent with DIM：bias reduction\n    confirmed，RMSE  tradeoff real，boundary conditions apply。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 18: Causal Forest Method Comparison (Aggregate)'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - mean_abs_bias\n    - mean_rmse\n    - debiasing_hurts_cases\n    key_rows:\n    - - naive_forest\n      - 0.156\n      - 0.178\n      - '-'\n    - - global_forest\n      - 0.107\n      - 0.166\n      - 9 configs (debiasing hurts)\n    - - ec_hte_forest\n      - 0.061\n      - 0.229\n      - '-'\n  - name: 'Table 19: CausalForest Debiasing-Hurts Detail'\n    columns:\n    - K\n    - regime\n    - subgroup\n    - naive_bias\n    - global_bias\n    - amplification\n    key_rows:\n    - - 4\n      - extreme\n      - sg0\n      - 0.018\n      - 0.106\n      - 5.9x\n    - - 4\n      - extreme\n      - sg1\n      - 0.045\n      - 0.089\n      - 2.0x\n    - - 2\n      - extreme\n      - sg0\n      - 0.033\n      - 0.109\n      - 3.3x\n  - name: 'Table 20: K=2/n=500 Detail (EC-HTE Sweet Spot)'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - sg0_bias\n    - sg1_bias\n    - mean_rmse\n    key_rows:\n    - - naive_forest\n      - 0.08\n      - 0.12\n      - 0.15\n    - - global_forest\n      - 0.06\n      - 0.07\n      - 0.14\n    - - ec_hte_forest\n      - 0.004\n      - 0.013\n      - 0.16\n  figures_description:\n  - 'DIM vs CausalForest amplification comparison: paired bar chart showing K=4/extreme\n    amplification for both estimators'\n  - 'Bias-RMSE tradeoff scatter: each method as a point, showing EC-HTE''s Pareto\n    position'\n  analysis: 'CausalForest 实验填补了 Claim 2 的 evidence gap（claim 提到 CausalForestDML 但需要  实验验证）。Median\n    档下 pattern 与 DIM consistent 但 amplification 更极端（5.9x vs 2.4x）， 强化了 bias mechanism\n    的 practical severity。RMSE tradeoff (+38%) 必须诚实报告—— 这是 median 档 \"bias-RMSE tradeoff\"\n    disclosure 的 empirical basis。Paper 中需  bias-RMSE tradeoff figure showing EC-HTE\n    dominates on bias but not RMSE。 K-dependence 非单调模式（DIM: K=2 > K=4; CF: K=4 >>\n    K=2）必须分 estimator 报告， 不能简单说 \"more subgroups → worse\"。'\n","numLines":1041,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1041}}}
